<view class="page-container page-container--padded"><top-bar title="今日"></top-bar><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="surface"><text class="muted">正在准备今天的内容…</text></view><block wx:else><view class="surface"><view class="section-title section-title--first">给今天的一句话</view><text wx:if="{{quote && quote.available}}" class="quote">{{quote.text}}</text><text wx:if="{{quote && quote.available}}" class="muted quote__source">{{quote.attribution}}</text><text wx:else class="muted">今天的短句暂未配置，先照顾好自己的节奏。</text></view><view class="section-title">今天的心情</view><view class="surface"><view wx:if="{{mood}}"><text>今天已记录：{{mood.mood}}</text><text class="muted">保存于 {{mood.recordedAt}}</text></view><block wx:else><view class="mood-grid"><view wx:for="{{moods}}" wx:key="*this" class="option {{selectedMood === item ? 'option--selected' : ''}}" data-mood="{{item}}" bindtap="selectMood">{{item}}</view></view><text class="muted">今天只记录一次，之后不会提供修改入口。</text><primary-button label="保存今天的心情" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{!selectedMood}}" bindaction="saveMood"></primary-button></block></view><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="需要留意" message="{{error}}" action-label="重新加载" bindaction="load"></state-message><view class="section-title">现在可以做什么</view><view class="surface"><view class="link-row" bindtap="goAssessment"><text>开始一次自我观察</text><text class="muted">›</text></view><view class="link-row" bindtap="goSupport"><text>查看支持资源</text><text class="muted">›</text></view><view class="link-row" bindtap="goMy"><text>查看我的记录</text><text class="muted">›</text></view></view></block><bottom-nav current="today"></bottom-nav></view>
